    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. but i guess i'm a bit worried about how to handle it if they bring up things that seem to go against what they see at school or what other parents might be saying. like, i hear some people saying that kids shouldn't be thinking about these things yet and that it's better to just stick to the basics of boy and girl. is it actually better for their development to lean into the spectrum idea instead of just keeping it simple?",
