      "content": "i see. so you're saying the \"boy/girl\" approach is basically just outdated and harmful? i guess i'm just wondering if there's really any merit at all to the other side—the idea that we shouldn't introduce these topics too early to preserve a sense of stability for them. is that view completely wrong, or is there a perspective you'd consider valid?",
